        "FlavorText": "\u0060Got him!\u0060 hissed Gollum in his ear. \u0060At last, my precious, we\u0060ve got him, yet, the nassty hobbit. We takes this one. She\u0060ll get the other. O yes, Selob will get him, not Sm\u00E9agol: he promised; he won\u0060t hurt Master at all. But he\u0060s got you, you nassty filthy little sneak!\u0060 He spat on Sam\u0060s neck. -The Two Towers"
